  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 888e5f6f5275ec2458800f028cedbfed, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level 1 Finish Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Length: 16
  Dialogue:
  - Hacks all done, all speakers are shut down in this sector
  - NOOOOOOOOOOOO
  - YOU RUINED EVERYTHING
  - What? was there some kind of master plan
  - Yeah man, it was a sweet gig, we play music and we get payed per people "captured"
    at our event
  - Captured??
  - Yeah some fanatic David Bowie type artists asked us to
  - We thought they just meant like... engaged or something
  - Did they say mention the music makes people CRAZY
  - Well ofcourse, music is supposed to make you go crazy, or else its just a low
    energy song
  - NO like... ugh nevermind
  - Dumb kids don't even know what theyre getting into. If what they say is true
    then maybe all the other concerts around the city are onto the same protocol
  - THERES MORE?? Hey, you better come help me fight
  - ehhhh you do it, these old bones can't move as fast as you
  - And you need your navigator / hacker right?
  - ...Fine
  OtherSpeakers:
  - Old Man
  - Band Kids
